      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1137177821,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I added a new header, <ws_unicode_code_points.h>, in the include directory; as the name indicates, it contains only code point #defines (just the one for REPLACEMENT CHARACTER, currenlty), *NOT* any includes of Windows headers that drag in namespace pollution such as definitions of `far` as a modifier - that broke the build in epan/dissectors/packet-pfcp.c, as that defines a structure with a member named `far`.",
